# Copy this file to .env in the same folder and fill in the value. .env is gitignored: never commit it, and never
# paste a key into a chat. The scripts read the value from your environment first, then from .env, and never print it.

# Optional. A Gemini API key for the watch pass (what changes on screen, second by second).
# Without it the run skips the watch notes and says so; everything else works. Create one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
